@startuml UC-53
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-53.md
title UC-53: View / Filter Orders
footer Feature AORD-01 | Business rules: BR-07
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "OData/OrdersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "OrderService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Open order list and choose filters\n(status, payment status, date range, order code)
MVC -> API : GET /odata/orders?$filter=OrderStatus eq '{status}'\n and PaymentStatus eq '{paymentStatus}'\n and CreatedAt ge {from} and CreatedAt le {to}\n and contains(OrderCode,'{code}')\n&$orderby=CreatedAt desc&$top=20&$skip={offset}&$count=true
API -> SVC : QueryOrders()
SVC --> API : IQueryable<OrderAdminListDto>
API -> DB : Apply OData options and execute query
DB --> API : Matching orders (+ total count)
API --> MVC : 200 OK { value, @odata.count }
alt no match
  MVC --> U : Show empty list
else orders found
  MVC --> U : Show paged order list
end

@enduml
